      "name": "Light Blindness",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Abrupt exposure to bright light (such as sunlight or a daylight spell) blinds a drow for 1 round. In addition, drow take a –1 circumstance penalty on all attack rolls, saves, and checks while operating in bright light.</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst1.html",
